## MCP Mutation Surface

Call `tools/list` first. It returns the effective tool set for the current
token. `tools/call` re-authorizes every call; mutating calls append
metadata-only audit rows, including denials.

Use `generate_workflow_preview` before any workflow write. The write path
requires `confirm_write: true`, `--allow-mutations`, and a separate
operator confirmation gesture in the chat UI.

Recover from `capability_missing`, `token_revoked`, `token_expired`,
`method_unknown`, and `mutations_disabled` by stopping and asking the
operator for the narrow correction named by the denial.
